{"4041500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vagabundo", "steam_appid": 4041500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagabundo is a cozy and contemplative game in which you accompany Mostro, a curious little dog who explores a vibrant jungle full of life, mountaineers, local animals, and fantastic creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no battles or enemies: just the calm of walking, discovering, and connecting with nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagabundo celebrates friendship, curiosity, and connection with the environment, inviting you to stop, breathe, and simply be present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ideal experience for those seeking tranquility, exploration, and genuine emotions without rushing or violent challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagabundo is a cozy and contemplative game in which you accompany Mostro, a curious little dog who explores a vibrant jungle full of life, mountaineers, local animals, and fantastic creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no battles or enemies: just the calm of walking, discovering, and connecting with nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagabundo celebrates friendship, curiosity, and connection with the environment, inviting you to stop, breathe, and simply be present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ideal experience for those seeking tranquility, exploration, and genuine emotions without rushing or violent challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Join Mostro, a curious little dog, on a cozy adventure through the jungle. Explore, meet animals and magical creatures, and discover the value of friendship in a living world that changes with weather and time of day.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>lang